{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":43,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["神應許拯救他的子民"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"雅各啊，創造你的耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，造成你的那位，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不要害怕！因為我救贖了你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾提你的名召你，你是屬我的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你從水中經過，我必與你同在；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你詵過江河，水必不漫過你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你從火中行過，必不被燒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"火焰也不着在你身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我是耶和華－你的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是以色列的聖者－你的救主；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已經使埃及作你的贖價，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使古實和西巴代替你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我看你為寶為尊；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又因我愛你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我使人代替你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列邦人替換你的生命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要害怕，因我與你同在；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必領你的後裔從東方來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又從西方招聚你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要對北方說，交出來！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對南方說，不要拘留！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將我的眾子從遠方帶來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將我的眾女從地極領回，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是凡稱為我名下的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我為自己的榮耀創造的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我所做成，所造作的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列是耶和華的見證人"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"你要將有眼而瞎、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有耳而聾的民都帶出來！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任憑萬國聚集；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任憑眾民會合。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中誰能將此聲明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並將先前的事說給我們聽呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們可以帶出見證來，自顯為是；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或者他們聽見便說：這是真的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：你們是我的見證，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所揀選的僕人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"既是這樣，便可以知道，且信服我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又明白我就是耶和華。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以前沒有真神","poem":1},{"noteId":41},{"text":"；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以後也必沒有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟有我是耶和華；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外沒有救主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾指示，我曾拯救，我曾說明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且在你們中間沒有別神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們是我的見證。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也是上帝；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自從有日子以來，我就是上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰也不能救人脫離我手。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要行事誰能阻止呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["逃離巴比倫"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和華－你們的救贖主、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的聖者如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你們的緣故，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已經打發人到巴比倫去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且我要使迦勒底人如逃民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都坐自己喜樂的船下來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和華－你們的聖者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是創造以色列的，是你們的君王。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華在滄海中開道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在大水中開路，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使車輛、馬匹、軍兵、勇士都出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同躺下，不再起來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們滅沒，好像熄滅的燈火。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不要記念從前的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要思想古時的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我要做一件新事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今要發現，你們豈不知道嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在曠野開道路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在沙漠開江河。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野地的走獸必尊重我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野狗和鴕鳥也必如此。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我使曠野有水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使沙漠有河，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好賜給我的百姓、我的選民喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這百姓是我為自己所造的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好述說我的美德。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列人的罪惡"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"雅各啊，你並沒有求告我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，你倒厭煩我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你沒有將你的羊帶來給我作燔祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有用祭物尊敬我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我沒有因供物使你服勞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有因乳香使你厭煩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你沒有用銀子為我買菖蒲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有用祭物的脂油使我飽足；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倒使我因你的罪惡服勞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我因你的罪孽厭煩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"惟有我為自己的緣故塗抹你的過犯；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不記念你的罪惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要提醒我，你我可以一同辯論；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你可以將你的理陳明，自顯為義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的始祖犯罪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的師傅違背我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要辱沒聖所的首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使雅各成為咒詛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使以色列成為辱罵。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":41,"caller":"-","text":"真：原文是造作的","reference":{"chapter":43,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/43.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/44.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/42.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":28}